# The develop pin, judged by CONTENT (see the header): sixteen files by blob at the CURRENT develop (documents.ts also by region), then — if develop
# moved — the pinned...develop delta against the GUARDED list with the DEV_CONTENT_ALLOWED blobs cleared.
